WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.021 --> 00:00:03.570
- All hour, we celebrated
Hip Hop's 50th anniversary.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.070
And now I have one more story to share.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.270
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.320
At the top of the show I said Hip hop

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.300
has touched every part of our culture.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.470
Even the culinary arts.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.180
Everybody, Louisville, Kentucky is home

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.780
to a hip hop theme bakery known
as the Hip Hop Sweet Shop.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.510
They're famous for their
milkshakes, which are awesome.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:24.780
There's the K R S One A K
A, the Caramel Apple Pie.

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:25.710
There's Diddy's,

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.590
I need a girl Strawberry
Cheesecake Milkshake.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:31.020
And there's the Eight
Mile Cookies and Cream,

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:32.670
which looks incredible.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:34.170
Let's get the owner in here right now.

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:38.253
Everybody say hello to Lafesa
watching on W D R B T tv.

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:40.187
What's up Lafesa?

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:42.180
- Hey guys.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.260
- I love your shirt.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:44.093
I love some Tupac.

00:00:44.093 --> 00:00:46.650
So tell us how you came up with
the idea in the first place.

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:48.870
- Well, I've been baking for 16 years

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:51.480
and I decided to combine my love

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.790
for hip hop and baking
and open a mobile bakery

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:56.200
in the urban community that I lived in.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.949
Everything that we make is named

00:00:58.949 --> 00:01:03.949
after hip hop artists, hip hop
songs, lingo, record labels.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:07.290
Um, We actually suffered
a devastating fire

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:09.240
on December the 21st.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:10.320
We've started a GoFundMe

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.300
and the community is
really rallying together

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.930
to help us raise funds to
come back bigger and better.

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:16.890
- I'm so sorry.

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:18.060
And right before Christmas.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:19.170
That sucks.

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:20.340
That had to be,
- Yeah.

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:21.480
- It's already devastating enough.

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.392
But especially on the holidays,
that's a, that's a hard hit.

00:01:24.392 --> 00:01:26.370
So how is the rebuilding coming along?

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:27.570
- It is coming along.

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:30.030
Uh, the community is really supporting our

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:34.020
GoFundMe to help raise funds to rebuild.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:34.980
I tell them that,

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:37.470
if we can survive Covid,
we will definitely,

00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:40.200
definitely survive this and
come back bigger and stronger.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.500
- Absolutely. Thank you so much, Lafesa.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:44.910
I'm liking your post right now

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:46.950
and I wish I had one of
your milkshakes right now.

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:48.270
Especially that Eight Mile, girl.

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:49.110
Uh, That's not all though.

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:50.878
Our season long partner
Pilot pen makers of G2

00:01:50.878 --> 00:01:53.310
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:55.680
want to help the Hip
Hop Sweet Shop reopen.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:56.820
So they're gonna be writing you a check

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:57.780
for a thousand dollars.

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:59.444
How's that sound?

00:01:59.444 --> 00:02:00.277
(applause)

00:02:00.277 --> 00:02:01.110
- Oh my God.

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:02.383
Thank you so much.

00:02:02.383 --> 00:02:03.508
- Absolutely.

00:02:03.508 --> 00:02:04.341
- Wasn't expecting that at all.

00:02:04.341 --> 00:02:06.095
- Oh my goodness. Thank you.

00:02:06.095 --> 00:02:08.220
- Aw, you have a beautiful
smile, by the way.

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:10.410
Alright, well thank you and
thank you so much everybody

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:13.110
for celebrating 50 years
of Hip Hop with us today.

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:14.880
And a big thank you to all of our guests.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:17.185
Chance the Rapper, Angie Martinez,

00:02:17.185 --> 00:02:20.610
Marquan Shumpert, Ziggy and DJ Cassidy.

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:21.704
Y'all have a great day and if it's not,

00:02:21.704 --> 00:02:22.923
try and change it.

